	(text "PWR-006: upstream U13 TPS63806YFFR, forced PWM.\nVnom=.5*(1+5600/(1000+10))=3.272277228V.\nStatic resistor/reference/leakage screen: 3.226819680..3.318012496V.\nWith one +/-75mV dynamics allocation: 3.151819680..3.393012496V.\nRST-002 MCU rising maximum 3.113278988V leaves 38.540692mV.\nRADIO-019 U4 TPS22964C: require <=20mV complete path at 505mA.\nRadio release margin =38.540692-20=18.540692mV, conditional.\nContinuous-rail RON, inrush, collapse and discharge need qualification.\nFull regulator calculations: design/main_regulator_tps63806.md.\nReset calculations: design/reset_coordination_tps3890.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.7 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/main_regulator_tps63806.md")
		)
		(uuid "1e311763-baef-42a6-83aa-c305d9e30b3d")
	)
	(text "RADIO-013: R11 / C6_EN reset pull-up\n10k 1%, 100ppm/C; deltaT=100 C allocation.\nRmin/max=10k*(1 +/-1%)*(1 +/-1%)=9801/10201 ohm.\nAllocate +/-12uA total adverse node leakage.\nIsink <=3.6/9801+12uA=0.379310mA <0.4mA.\nU6 VOL<=0.25V at 0.4mA, VDD>=1.5V.\nAt C6 table point 3.3V, 25 C:\nVEN>=3.3-12uA*10201=3.177588V >2.475V VIH.\nVIL=0.825V; low margin=0.825-0.25=0.575V.\nPmax=3.6^2/9801=1.322314mW.\nMR arbitration, power states and timing remain open.\nMath: ../design/radio_interface.md (RADIO-013)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 317.5 185.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-013-reset-output-and-module-enable-pull-up")
		)
		(uuid "2fdd2c9d-c4d2-41f1-abba-69e229915ff5")
	)
	(text "RADIO-018: TP3 internal C6 BOOT service pads; no fitted switch.\nFixture shorts pad 1 (GPIO9) to pad 2 (GND); GPIO8 must be high.\nHold GPIO9 low before C6_EN rises and >=3ms after C6_EN rises.\nR16 external current <=3.6/9801=0.367309mA; add internal pull-up.\nFixture ALLOCATION: total sink <=1mA and path <=1ohm => Vlow<=1mV.\nAt 3.3V: low margin=0.25*3.3-0.001=0.824V (screen only).\nHost-independent radio power/reset arbitration remains to be connected.\nMath: ../design/radio_interface.md#radio-018-internal-boot-service-pads	"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 261.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "37a8794a-3bd6-4f3c-8355-ab4a7cf733da")
	)
	(text "RADIO-017: R15/R16/R17 boot/debug strap pull-ups to switched radio rail.\nFlash boot: GPIO9=1. Download: GPIO8=1, GPIO9=0; service pads TP3 (RADIO-018).\nGPIO15=1 selects USB JTAG with applicable eFuses; retain straps >=3ms after EN rises.\nRmin/max=10k*(1+/-1%)*(1+/-100ppm/K*100K)=9801/10201 ohm.\nAt 3.3V: Vhigh>=3.3-12uA*10201=3.177588V; VIH=2.475V; margin=0.702588V.\nExternal low-state current<=3.6/9801=0.367309mA each; P<=1.322314mW each.\n12uA total/node is an allocation. Internal pull-up sink current and full-state timing OPEN.\nMath: ../design/radio_interface.md#radio-017-boot-and-debug-strap-bias	"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 254 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "507afa9f-8d1c-4d3d-9608-4fcc0ca79e5b")
	)
	(text "RADIO-009: U5 isolates host and switched-radio signal domains.\nC49/C50: 100 nF local bypass; TI TXU0304 section 12.1.\nC50 adds 0.1 uF: fitted external radio capacitance = 10.2 uF nominal.\n5 MHz budget: 100 - 11 - 11 = 78 ns remaining (5 pF test load).\nSPI/OE and reset qualification remain open; timing is not closed.\nMath: ../design/radio_interface.md#radio-009-spi-power-domain-isolation"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 124.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-009-spi-power-domain-isolation")
		)
		(uuid "65624b99-0e43-4086-bb29-811c3a766cfa")
	)
	(text "RADIO-019: U4 TPS22964CYZPT radio power gating\nRST-002: 3.151819680 - 0.020 - 3.113278988\n= 18.540692 mV conditional reset-release margin.\n505 mA: switch <=30 mOhm + rest <=9.6 mOhm\nrequired for <=20 mV path; qualification pending.\nInternal slew: 715 us TYP; no CT capacitor.\nQOD: 273 ohm TYP / 325 max; external C = 10.2uF.\nModule C and leakage unknown; no guaranteed off-time.\nRCB only disabled, either rail >1 V; decay unqualified.\nMath: ../design/radio_interface.md (RADIO-019)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 187.96 154.432 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-019-tps22964c-low-loss-switch-migration")
		)
		(uuid "6ee9ae5e-64a4-457a-b04f-1c82cf26dbc0")
	)
	(text "RADIO-003: C46 bulk bypass / TDK C3216X7R1V106K160AC\n10 uF nominal, +/-10%, X7R; DC bias reduces capacitance.\nC(3.3 V) = 9.69875 + (3.3-3.15)/0.85*(9.38950-9.69875)\n             = 9.64418 uF; C(3.6 V) = 9.53503 uF (nominal).\nSource curve interpolation, NOT a guaranteed minimum.\nRail: 3.0..3.6 V; source capability >= 0.5 A.\nSupply and transmit transient qualification remain required.\nCalculations: ../design/radio_interface.md#radio-003-bulk-capacitance"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.446 93.726 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-003-bulk-capacitance")
		)
		(uuid "73b39401-7019-496b-9457-6f1577917331")
	)
	(text "RADIO-010: R9/R10 idle-state bias, 10k 1%\nRmin/max = 10k*(1 +/-1%)*(1 +/-1%) = 9801/10201 ohm.\n12 uA adverse leakage is an ALLOCATION, not measured.\nR9: Vlow = 12u*10201 = 0.122412 V.\nTI VT- min = 0.17 V at the 1.1 V equal-rail test point.\nR10 @3.3 V: VCS >=3.177588 V > VIH 2.475 V (25 C).\nR9 enabled current = 3.3/10k = 0.330 mA.\nR10 draws similar current only while CS is low.\nOE arbitration, all-state leakage and timing remain open.\nMath: ../design/radio_interface.md#radio-010-idle-state-bias"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-010-idle-state-bias")
		)
		(uuid "75b4af6d-5689-4dd7-8c8a-06293f9ec382")
	)
	(text "RADIO-015: U7 Schmitt-input reset arbitration\nIN1=GND: Y = MCU_RESET_N AND RADIO_RESET_REQ_N.\nEither low asserts U6 MR; C53 = 100nF MCU-rail bypass.\nR14: Rmin/max=10k*(1 +/-1%)*(1 +/-1%)=9801/10201 ohm.\n12uA adverse-current ALLOCATION: Vlow <= 0.122412 V.\nAt U7 3V test point: VT-_min-Vlow = 0.717588 V.\nAt 3.6V: I_R14 <= 0.367309 mA; P <= 1.322314 mW.\nIf |I_U7out|<=100uA: MR low/high margins >=0.65/0.8V\non shared 3.0-3.6V rail. MR load bound NOT yet verified.\nReset hierarchy connected; full-rail thresholds/sequencing open.\nMath: ../design/radio_interface.md#radio-015-reset-request-arbitration"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.2 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-015-reset-request-arbitration")
		)
		(uuid "80fa67e3-4738-46a7-8272-d6dc5e749f56")
	)
	(text "RADIO-005: C47 / U4 VIN local bypass\n10 uF nominal, +/-10%, 35 V X7R; same exact TDK part as C46.\nC(3.3 V) = 9.69875 + (3.3-3.15)/0.85*(9.38950-9.69875)\n             = 9.64418 uF nominal; NOT a guaranteed minimum.\nDroop = integral(Iload-Isource)dt / Ceff + ESR/ESL effects.\nTI section 11: 1 uF usually sufficient; slow sources may need more.\nC47 is upstream: exclude it from C45+C46 output-discharge math.\nRegulator/transient qualification required; no source flag added.\nCalculations: ../design/radio_interface.md#radio-005-input-bypass"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.46 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-005-input-bypass")
		)
		(uuid "8ba59534-1ba2-416f-9640-73339628a0f6")
	)
	(text "RADIO-016: SPI_IO_EN = C6_EN AND RADIO_PWR_EN\nR9 bounds: 9.801k..10.201k (1%, 100ppm/K, 100K).\nIhigh <= 3.6/9801 + 12uA = 0.379309mA.\n3V test-point margins: 2.4-1.92=0.48V high;\n0.89-0.45=0.44V low. Full-rail sequencing OPEN.\n12uA/node allocation includes U8; other loads unqualified.\nCalculations: ../design/radio_interface.md#radio-016-spi-output-enable-arbitration"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8c0c2d13-1dc7-4e01-a9e1-9af793f086d4")
	)
	(text "RADIO-019: internal slew / conditional discharge screens\nTI tR(10..90%)=715us TYP at 3.3V, 25C, 10 ohm load,\nCIN=1uF/COUT=0.1uF; not this board or worst-case timing.\nExternal C45+C46+C50=10.2uF nominal; module C unknown.\nIcap=10.2uF*(0.8*3.3V)/715us=37.661538mA (linear TYP).\nt90..10=R*C*ln(9): 6.118392ms at 273 ohm TYP;\n7.283799ms using 325 ohm table max at ON=0, IOUT=2mA.\nIdeal RC only; C corners, leakage, VIN decay need qualification.\nKeep radio OFF during host cold/wake inrush; wait for rail settle.\nVerify U6/C6 reset interval independently; no fixed off-time.\nMath: ../design/radio_interface.md (RADIO-019)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 228.6 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-019-tps22964c-low-loss-switch-migration")
		)
		(uuid "a3b0d9cd-be71-4d46-b834-9a684f501730")
	)
	(text "RADIO-019: R7=4.7k / R8=10k, active-high ON, default OFF\n1% initial x 100ppm/C x 100C; adverse Ileak=+/-12uA.\nVON=(Vhost/R7+Ileak)/(1/R7+1/R8); use resistor corners.\nValid host VOL<=0.5V / VOH>=2.5V; pull-up disabled.\nVlow<=0.383594V <0.4V; Vhigh>=1.639635V >1.3V.\nHost source current <=0.261871mA in this envelope.\nHi-Z: 12uA*10201=0.122412V; leakage allocation required.\nNo logic guarantee once host leaves its valid voltage range.\nSource collapse, startup and shutdown qualification remain open.\nMath: ../design/radio_interface.md (RADIO-019)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 228.6 185.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-019-tps22964c-low-loss-switch-migration")
		)
		(uuid "b3fe64c9-81e0-47c7-9dd2-5988e0a7a95a")
	)
	(text "RADIO-014 / RST-002: R12=33k, R13=20k switched-radio SENSE divider.\n0.05%, 10ppm/C; allocate 100C, +/-0.15% installed drift, +/-150nA total.\nfL=.9995*.999*.9985; fH=1.0005*1.001*1.0015.\nKlo=1+33000*fL/(20000*fH); Khi=1+33000*fH/(20000*fL).\nE=150nA*33000*fH; Vtrip=Vthreshold*(1+Rt/Rb)+Is*Rt.\nVfall=1.15*.99*Klo-E .. 1.15*1.01*Khi+E = 3.000822727..3.094473285V.\nVrise=1.157*.99*Klo-E .. 1.157*1.01*Khi+E = 3.019118825..3.113278988V.\nUse direct VITP limits; do not add hysteresis a second time.\nRADIO-019 U4 TPS22964C: 3.151819680-.020-3.113278988\n=18.540692mV conditional release margin; <=20mV path at 505mA required.\n30mOhm installed switch allocation needs full-range qualification.\nNo radio DC/startup or fast-brownout sign-off from this model.\nC52=1n charge interval .814828..1.526476ms; not total IC delay maximum.\nFull assumptions, sourcing and Python: design/reset_coordination_tps3890.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.7 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/reset_coordination_tps3890.md")
		)
		(uuid "c87b6eaf-8d4f-4da0-88a2-efff6aae0d55")
	)
	(text "RADIO-012: C52 / U6 reset-release delay\nC52 = 1nF +/-5% NP0, CT to GND (not VIN).\nAt 100 C excursion, +/-30 ppm/C: 947.15..1053.15 pF.\ntnom = 1nF*1.23V/1.15uA + 25us = 1.094565 ms.\nAllocate +/-10nA external CT leakage; start discharged.\ntcharge_min = 947.15pF*1.17V/1.36uA = 814.828 us.\ntcharge_max = 1053.15pF*1.29V/0.89uA = 1526.476 us.\nCharge-only screen, NOT total reset min/max limits.\nC6 requires 50us stable supply and 50us reset low.\nComplete reset sequencing remains open.\nMath: ../design/radio_interface.md#radio-012-supervisor-reset-release-delay"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.7 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-012-supervisor-reset-release-delay")
		)
		(uuid "ef90dbfa-f81a-4b92-b0a7-0c26bdde4289")
	)
